5895	5969	5887	5887	Alice	412	" Indeed I do,--every step of the way . Cabs are so ruinous . It 's a most unfortunate thing ; they always say it 's just over the two miles here . I do n't believe a word of it , because I 'm only a little more than the half - hour walking it ; and those men will say anything . But how can I prove it , you know ? "
