13885	14035	13702	13702	Kate	424	" Exactly ; but that 's just what you ca n't do , my dear . You do n't forgive him . If you did you might be quite sure that I should say nothing . And if you choose to bid me hold my tongue I will say nothing . But when you tell me all your own thoughts about this thing you can hardly expect but that I should let you know mine in return . I 'm not particular ; and if you are ready for a little good , wholesome , useful hypocrisy , I wo n't balk you . I may n't be quite so dishonest as you call me , but I 'm not so wedded to truth but what I can look , and act , and speak a few falsehoods if you wish it . Only let us understand each other . "
