126152	126275	125997	125997	Glencora	544	" Yes , I do ; that is to say , I did come very often when we had the full moon in August . The weather was n't like this , and I used to run out through the open windows and nobody knew where I was gone . I made him come once , but he did n't seem to care about it . I told him that part of the refectory wall was falling ; so he looked at that , and had a mason sent the next day . If anything is out of order he has it put to rights at once . There would have been no ruins if all the Pallisers had been like him . "
