377080	377178	377076	377076	her	544	" You have made everything right , my little man . But oh , Alice , if you had seen the Duke 's long face through those three days ; if you had heard the tones of the people 's voices as they whispered about me ; if you had encountered the oppressive cheerfulness of those two London doctors,--doctors are such bad actors,--you would have thought it impossible for any woman to live throughout . There 's one comfort;--if my mannikin lives , I ca n't have another eldest . He looks like living;--don't he , Alice ? "
